. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H1 * 
. 
.         * Verbal description of the model: We run a linear OLS regression ana
> lysis with left-leaning political preferences (plh0004) as dependent variable
>  and the dummy variable daughter as independent variable, controlling for var
> ious covariates and using standard errors clustered at the household level.
. 
.         global controls hghinc hghinc_missing pgbilzeit pgbilzeit_missing age
>  age_missing age_sq age_sq_missing female female_missing age_oldest_child age
> _oldest_child_missing age_oldest_child_sq age_oldest_child_sq_missing nb_chil
> dren_indicator_2 nb_children_indicator_2_missing nb_children_indicator_3 nb_c
> hildren_indicator_3_missing

. 
